OL,3,GNEWSANo babies to be born at Daisy Hill
OL,4,AHospital in service suspension plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo babies will be delivered at Daisy
OL,7,FHill Hospital in Newry if plans for a
OL,8,Ftemporary suspension of services go
OL,9,Fahead amid "significant" workforce
OL,10,Fpressures.
OL,12,FThe Southern Trust has not been able to
OL,13,Frecruit consultant obstetricians to
OL,14,Ffill vacancies and it is preparing to
OL,15,Ftemporarily move inpatient maternity
OL,16,Fservices to Craigavon Area Hospital.
OL,18,FIt said it "cannot run a safe maternity
OL,19,Fservice without the required medical
OL,20,Fcover and unfortunately that is a
OL,21,Fposition that the trust is having to
OL,22,Fplan for at this moment in time".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
